### ============================================
### F07 — Funis de Vendas (Kanban)
### ============================================
### Variaveis:
###   {{base_url}}     = http://localhost:8533
###   {{tenant_token}} = JWT com tenant_id selecionado

### --- Kanban ---

### Pagina principal do Kanban
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Fragmento do kanban (HTMX)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/kanban?funnel_id={{funnel_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Buscar leads no kanban
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/kanban?search=maria&funnel_id={{funnel_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### --- Funis ---

### Listar funis
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Criar funil
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Consultoria Trabalhista&description=Pipeline principal

### Detalhe do funil
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Editar funil
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Consultoria Trabalhista 2026&description=Pipeline atualizado

### Ativar/desativar funil
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/toggle
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### --- Colunas ---

### Listar colunas do funil
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Criar coluna
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Proposta Enviada&type=intermediate&color=%23eab308

### Mover coluna para cima
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns/{{column_id}}/move-up
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Mover coluna para baixo
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns/{{column_id}}/move-down
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Remover coluna
DELETE {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/columns/{{column_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### --- Leads ---

### Detalhe do lead (drawer)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/{{lead_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Criar anotacao no lead
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/{{lead_id}}/notes
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

content=Ligar amanha para agendar reuniao

### Mover lead
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/{{lead_id}}/move
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

column_id={{column_id}}&funnel_id={{funnel_id}}

### ============================================
### Testes OWASP
### ============================================

### Sem token (401)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads

### Sem tenant (403)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads
Cookie: token={{admin_token_sem_tenant}}

### SQL injection na busca
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/kanban?search=%27%20OR%201%3D1%20--
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Token invalido (401)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads
Cookie: token=invalid.token

### ============================================
### F08 Step 4 — Responsible assigned automatically on create
### ============================================
### After POST /leads or an inbound WhatsApp message creates a lead, the
### returned/listed lead carries a non-empty responsible_user_id. When
### the destination funnel/column has no active load-balance group, the
### responsible falls back to the tenant owner.
###
### Set {{lead_id}} after creation (via kanban/WhatsApp flow).

GET {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/{{lead_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
### Expect: response body includes "responsible_user_id": "<uuid>"
